{
  "title": "Machinemodule",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "The Machinedrum",
        "SPS-1 UW sound",
        "engine, emulated.",
        "",
        "16 tracks on the",
        "16 drum pads:",
        "pad 1 = track 1",
        "(notes 36-51).",
        "",
        "Hit a pad: every",
        "page shows that",
        "track."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pages",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "Track pages",
          "lines": [
            "Track: TRK, MACH,",
            " LEVEL, MUTE",
            "Synth: the 8 SYN",
            " knobs, with the",
            " machine's names",
            "Amp/Filter: AMD",
            " AMF EQF EQG FLTF",
            " FLTW FLTQ SRR",
            "Mix: DIST VOL PAN",
            " DEL REV",
            "LFO: TRACK PARAM",
            " SHP1 SHP2 UPDTE",
            " SPEED DEPTH SHMIX"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Kit pages",
          "lines": [
            "Kit: Init, your",
            " factory kits and",
            " your own kits",
            "Echo, Reverb, EQ,",
            " Dynamix: the",
            " master effects",
            "Master: settings"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Master page",
          "lines": [
            "FX: Off, Full or",
            " Rev+Echo (no EQ",
            " or Dynamix: less",
            " CPU, quieter)",
            "LTNCY: 1-4 blocks",
            " of 2.9 ms. Raise",
            " it if it clicks",
            "VELMD: MD or VEL",
            "ACTHR, ACAMT: the",
            " MD mode's accent",
            "VOICS: how many",
            " tracks sound at",
            " once (16 = all)",
            "LOAD, PEAK: CPU"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Velocity",
      "lines": [
        "VELMD MD: a hit at",
        "or above ACTHR is",
        "accented, as the",
        "MD's own accent.",
        "Softer hits play",
        "ACAMT lower.",
        "",
        "VELMD VEL: the",
        "velocity sets the",
        "level, like other",
        "instruments."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Files",
      "lines": [
        "Upload on the",
        "module's page:",
        "",
        "os: the MD UW",
        " OS 1.63 .syx",
        " (required, free",
        " from Elektron)",
        "flash: the MD's",
        " flash image .bin",
        " (optional: the",
        " factory kits and",
        " ROM samples; the",
        " first start takes",
        " about 6 minutes)",
        "kits: your own",
        " kit dumps (.syx)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "CPU",
      "lines": [
        "A busy kit with",
        "the master FX is",
        "a lot for a Move.",
        "If it clicks:",
        "LTNCY 2, then FX",
        "Rev+Echo, then",
        "VOICS 8 or less."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
